  "text": "3 actions: Transfer 0.0005 SOL from 8Aet…tiTo to 879A…MGsA; Wrap 0.0495 SOL into wrapped SOL account 4hJnan1NC4BuwPSn41WAQ7yG3zMK5JfXzDiq8jw2VH6R via DFlow; DFlow swap whose route cannot be resolved\nBLOCKED BY DEFAULT (1 critical finding)\n\nFindings:\n  [CRITICAL] The accounts that fix the route's layout are loaded from lookup tables the signer cannot read (instruction 5)\n  [INFO] The token program account is loaded from a lookup table; the Associated Token Account program only accepts the SPL Token and Token-2022 programs (instruction 2)\n\n== Transfer | System program (verified)\n  Amount: 0.0005 SOL\n  From: 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo\n  To: 879ArayuxbYjBhpUe4QCx8nqaAKjiwCG1hFiJo6zMGsA\n\n== Wrap SOL | DFlow Aggregator (descriptor reviewed 2026-10-17, upgradeable by 9uo2…wgsh)\n  Amount: 0.0495 SOL\n  From: 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo\n  Wrapped SOL account: 4hJnan1NC4BuwPSn41WAQ7yG3zMK5JfXzDiq8jw2VH6R\n\n== DFlow swap | DFlow Aggregator (verified)\n  Accounts: 29\n  Data: 0xf8c69e91e17587c8020000002559b35cd41ea8b5ed990f7a372f0548abc990271cca751964e9edf871f6da04a15a581b64800dff940fd6c6d37ca8ce453f36232f143c7549e8a11428b454dd0217330f1b00005a410000000008604ff3020000000003c24172cc24000000e8030000\n\n== Also [collapsed]\n  Compute unit limit: 500000\n  Compute unit price: 149986 micro-lamports per unit\n  Create token account if missing: Token account: 9SQZUTsLbv469tCRm9BFo64vpUiWToZukM4WeNdDGxVU\n  Create token account if missing: Owner: 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo\n  Create token account if missing: Mint: HMYd9tosnUXuNHmq7pXmoePRVBLBBjA3JBfydq6upump\n  Create token account if missing: Rent paid by: 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo\n  Create token account if missing: Token program: not read (lookup table 9rVP…5hT9[6])\n  Jito tip: Amount: 0.000122053 SOL\n  Jito tip: From: 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo\n  Jito tip: To: Jito tip account (96gY…rZU5) (verified)\n\n== Signers\n  Fee payer: 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo\n\n== Fee\n  Total: 0.000079993 SOL\n  Base: 0.000005 SOL\n  Priority: 0.000074993 SOL\n  Priority basis: 149986 micro-lamports per unit × 500000 units requested\n  Rent deposits: up to 0.00148844 SOL if the accounts it creates only when missing do not exist yet; returned when the accounts are closed\n\n== Validity\n  Expires: in about a minute (recent blockhash)\n\nEffects:\n  - Transfer 0.0005 SOL from 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo to 879ArayuxbYjBhpUe4QCx8nqaAKjiwCG1hFiJo6zMGsA\n  - Transfer 0.0495 SOL from 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo to 4hJnan1NC4BuwPSn41WAQ7yG3zMK5JfXzDiq8jw2VH6R\n  - Creates the wrapped SOL account first if it does not exist, as the sender's associated token account and at the sender's cost; the program's source is not public, and this is what its mainnet transactions show\n  - Create 9SQZUTsLbv469tCRm9BFo64vpUiWToZukM4WeNdDGxVU owned by not read (lookup table 9rVP…5hT9[6]), depositing 0.00148844 SOL unless it already exists\n  - Transfer 0.000122053 SOL from 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo to Jito tip account (96gY…rZU5) (verified)\n  - 8AetkDchMd7bP6EnGip9M7p5Towr2kdMTJbKAj8HtiTo pays a fee of 0.000079993 SOL\n  - Valid for about a minute (recent blockhash)\n\nRaw: solana v0 (798 bytes)\n  digest: b892642d9d9599ea782feb6bffdc9939bf6aa2c699eb2c67b6e5d3463baa7682\n",
